      "reading": {
        "title": "A short connected story",
        "paragraphs": [
          {
            "hanzi": "妈妈去商店买一把椅子和一张桌子。桌子有点儿贵，但是椅子很便宜。",
            "pinyin": "Māma qù shāngdiàn mǎi yì bǎ yǐzi hé yì zhāng zhuōzi. Zhuōzi yǒudiǎnr guì, dànshì yǐzi hěn piányi.",
            "english": "Mom goes to the shop to buy a chair and a table. The table is a little expensive, but the chair is cheap."
          }
